Ubunye Photo distribution

Ubunye Photo (https://github.com/ubunye-ai-ecosystems/ubunye-creative-photo) is a modified
version of PhotoCraft, made by Ubunye AI Ecosystems and distributed by ThabangVision. It is based
on PhotoCraft by the ArtCraft team (https://github.com/storytold/photocraft) and stays under the
same licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0. Modifications are Copyright (c) 2026 Ubunye AI Ecosystems. The
upstream copyright and notices above are unchanged.

As docs/brand/LICENSE-brand.txt requires for modified versions, Ubunye Photo does not include or
show the ArtCraft Marks: the logo files in docs/brand/ are removed in this distribution (the licence
text stays), and Ubunye Photo is not an ArtCraft product. ArtCraft and PhotoCraft are named only in
plain-text credit.

The Ubunye Photo app icon (assets/app-icon/) is Ubunye AI Ecosystems artwork adapted from the
ThabangVision logo, MIT OR Apache-2.0; its letter outline comes from DM Serif Display (SIL Open
Font License 1.1). It replaces upstream's kitsune icon.
